{"bfh": [{"id": "bfh", "headword": "बृह्", "headword_slp1": "bfh", "fold": "bfh", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "1 बृह् (वृह्), बृह॑ति (वृह॑ति), pp. बृढ (वृढ॑)\npluck, tear out. — आ tear off, root out. उद् & समुद् draw forth.\nनि throw down;\n C. the same, destroy, annihilate. प्र tear out or\noff, snatch away;\n tear asunder, destroy;\n M. = उपप्र M. draw towards\none's self, attract. वि rend asunder, break up, split, destroy,\nremove. सम् rend asunder, draw out (together).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "2 बृह् बृह॑ति (only बृह॑न्त् q.v.) & बृंहति, बृंह˚ते;\nC. बृंह॑यति, ˚ते, pp. बृंहित (q.v.) make great or big,\nstrengthen, augment, further. — अभि C. strengthen, increase,\naugment. उप the same;\n I. (बर्बृहि) press or embrace close. समुप\nC. strengthen, supply, complete. परि A. M. enclose, encircle, make\ntight or firm, strengthen, fortify. C. strengthen, augment. सम् join\nfirmly together. C. संवर्हयति join together, attach (dat.);\nसंबृंहयति strengthen, encourage. — Cf. उपबृंहित, परिबृढ,\nपरिवृढ.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "3 बृह् (वृह्) बृंहति (वृंहति), pp. बृंहित (q.v.) roar.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "4 †बृह् v. बृ॑हस्प॑ति.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "bfhacCoka": [{"id": "bfhacCoka", "headword": "बृहच्छोक", "headword_slp1": "bfhacCoka", "fold": "bfhacCoka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "बृहच्छोक a. having great sorrow.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "bfhacCravas": [{"id": "bfhacCravas", "headword": "बृहच्छ्रवस्", "headword_slp1": "bfhacCravas", "fold": "bfhacCravas", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "बृह॑च्छ्रवस् a. loud-sounding or = seq.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "bfhacCloka": [{"id": "bfhacCloka", "headword": "बृहच्छ्लोक", "headword_slp1": "bfhacCloka", "fold": "bfhacCloka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "capeller-sanskrit-english", "senses": [{"glos